OL,3,GNEWSATwelve taken to hospital after
OL,4,ADouglas flats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital following a fire at a block of
OL,8,Fflats in Douglas.
OL,10,FCrews arrived at the building on Bucks
OL,11,FRoad at about 03:40 BST on Wednesday
OL,12,Fmorning, the Isle of Man Fire and
OL,13,FRescue has said.
OL,15,FSeveral people were trapped inside, and
OL,16,F25 firefighters worked to get people
OL,17,Fout, including two from the top floor.
OL,19,FIn total, 12 people were rescued from
OL,20,Fthe building who were treated at the
OL,21,Fscene and taken to Noble's Hospital for
OL,22,F"precautionary checks".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
